# Names only. Copy to deploy/worker-flow.env and fill in on the box; the real file is never committed (gitignored).
# The reCAPTCHA solver keys (flow.captcha_provider picks yescaptcha, capsolver, anticaptcha, or an order of them):
# FLOW_YESCAPTCHA_KEY (YesCaptcha client key), FLOW_CAPSOLVER_KEY (CapSolver API key), FLOW_ANTICAPTCHA_KEY
# (Anti-Captcha account key). Secrets of this worker only, read once at start and removed from the environment; one
# left empty is "not set" (flow.captcha_key_invalid when its source is chosen).
DATABASE_URL=
MINIO_ENDPOINT=
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=
MINIO_REGION=
CREDENTIAL_SEAL_PRIVATE_KEY=
BILLING_TZ=
FLOW_YESCAPTCHA_KEY=
FLOW_CAPSOLVER_KEY=
FLOW_ANTICAPTCHA_KEY=
